            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.13

- The full-screen background now uses the album art's actual dominant colors, so it matches the cover instead of inventing bright hues. A neutral cover gives a soft neutral wash; a colorful cover gives a vivid one.
- The dominant tone fills the whole screen (no dark base), so the backdrop reads brighter and fuller — closer to Apple Music.
]]></description>
